</details>

## Privacy as exact equality, not visual similarity

The simulator chooses $z$ and works backward to $a=\varphi(z)-[c]y$. Translation $r\mapsto r+[c]w$ is a bijection, so uniform real tapes and uniform simulator responses create exactly the same transcript multiset.

